WEBVTT

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:10.377
This is FRANK. An operations core that runs on your own machine, looking after three businesses.

00:00:11.527 --> 00:00:27.175
First tile, the morning briefing. Nineteen degrees and clear in Sydney. Three things need you today. A carousel waiting on approval, three quotes unanswered past a week, and one listing held on a print error. Nothing has been sent.

00:00:28.325 --> 00:00:39.605
Second tile, your business lines. Harbourline Coffee, Northbridge Joinery, Saltbush Studio. Northbridge is flagged, because those three quotes have gone quiet.

00:00:40.755 --> 00:00:52.563
Third tile, the approval gate. One item held. Thursday's Instagram carousel for Harbourline. Four slides, drafted, designed, and quality checked.

00:00:53.713 --> 00:00:56.161
It sits here until you say so.

00:00:57.311 --> 00:01:01.631
Approved. Released to the scheduler, and the queue is clear.

00:01:02.781 --> 00:01:08.517
Everything else ran overnight. Nothing is sent, spent or published without you.
